[[0,311412,0,14,1,13,"2015-07-19T17:55:41","Alduin","",[],"","Obama's Secretive Gun Ban For Social Security Beneficiaries","http://www.breitbart.com/big-government/2015/07/18/obamas-secretive-gun-ban-for-social-security-beneficiaries/","politics"],[1,1170959,0,2,3,-1,"2015-07-19T20:06:20","Duckies","",[],"<p>Can we please ban sources like breitbart, drudge report, and whatever their liberal counterparts are? They aren't news; they're propaganda. It is difficult to have an informed discussion when the waters get muddied by such places.</p>"],[2,1171601,1170959,6,0,6,"2015-07-19T20:34:10","kingbird","",[],"<p>Banning sources and censorship is a slippery slope, specially in political news. That is why a lot of us are here on Voat and not on &quot;that other site&quot;.\r\nThe source of the news is always shown, if you do not trust a source do not click on it, ignore it. </p>"]]
[[0,311413,0,11,0,11,"2015-07-19T17:55:57","Confusion","",[],"","Loot Crate will be having a Fallout crate soon","https://i.imgur.com/ueTssHv.jpg","Fallout"],[1,1167949,0,3,0,3,"2015-07-19T17:58:10","Confusion","",[],"<p>What is Loot Crate? Pay a few dollars a month and they will ship you a mystery box full of random themed crap.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=97PlypCTMEA\">Example.</a></p>\n<p>They are traditionally total crap and a disappointment. Still, I might get this one. Use this code: ANEXCELLENTCODE for a discount.</p>"],[2,1190482,1167949,0,0,0,"2015-07-20T11:11:10","zngraceland","",[],"<p>It's a D&amp;D shirt. Come on.</p>"],[2,1268322,1167949,0,0,0,"2015-07-22T19:43:16","FaithPowerKittens","",[],"<p>How have you got a discount code already? Or is that a code for a subscription?</p>"],[1,1169730,0,1,0,1,"2015-07-19T19:12:40","Rb8623","",[],"<p><a href=\"http://media.giphy.com/media/DB2oahQFa0qeQ/giphy.gif\">http://media.giphy.com/media/DB2oahQFa0qeQ/giphy.gif</a></p>"]]
